[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Raise the vehicle in the area\nconcerned.</p><p>1. Remove the retaining clip.</p><p>2. Unscrew the nuts.</p><p>3. Remove the side skirt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005450.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the side skirt is\nundamaged.</p><p>Refit the side skirt and secure with nuts.</p><p>Fit the retaining spring.</p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p>"]]